  "overview": "Scramble! Bogey at 12 O'Clock!\n\nHit the skies and kick in those afterburners. Watch out for incomings as you pummel air, land, and sea targets with everything you've got, from Vulcan cannons to high-performance missiles. Keep jinking through because they're not gonna let you invade without paying the price.\n\n- Arcade-perfect conversion.\n- Exclusive Ranking Mode available only on Sega Saturn.\n- Blast through 12 unique levels - from deserts to jungles to cities.\n- Pick from four of the most advanced attack fighters ever to hit the skies.\n- Incredible real-time 3D environments."
